169
00:09:57,400 --> 00:09:59,400
How are your plans for your next

170
00:09:59,400 --> 00:10:01,400
High Adventure trip coming along?

171
00:10:01,400 --> 00:10:03,400
You know that it's a great experience.

172
00:10:03,400 --> 00:10:05,400
You know that it'll do more for your Scouts

173
00:10:05,400 --> 00:10:07,400
than you can imagine,

174
00:10:07,400 --> 00:10:09,400
but most of us, you know-

175
00:10:09,400 --> 00:10:11,400
let's face facts- we don't get started, do we?

176
00:10:11,400 --> 00:10:13,400
We think it's either too expensive

177
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:15,400
or we're doubt we're going to have the time,

178
00:10:15,400 --> 00:10:17,400
or we lack the skills or confidence

179
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:19,400
to get the ball rolling.

180
00:10:19,400 --> 00:10:21,400
The open secret, though, is that High Adventure

181
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:23,400
does not have to be

182
00:10:23,400 --> 00:10:25,400
expensive or difficult

183
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:27,400
or complex, right.

184
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:29,400
Many troops and crews

185
00:10:29,400 --> 00:10:31,400
make their own plans and offer

186
00:10:31,400 --> 00:10:33,400
High Adventure experiences to their Scouts

187
00:10:33,400 --> 00:10:35,400
on a regular basis.

188
00:10:35,400 --> 00:10:37,400
We want to talk for a moment

189
00:10:37,400 --> 00:10:39,400
about putting together a High Adventure program

190
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:41,400
suited to the ambitions

191
00:10:41,400 --> 00:10:43,400
and abilities of your Scouts.

192
00:10:43,400 --> 00:10:45,400
It's not as expensive or difficult

193
00:10:45,400 --> 00:10:47,400
or time-consuming as you might think.

194
00:10:47,400 --> 00:10:49,400
For the past 10 years,

195
00:10:49,400 --> 00:10:51,400
we have alternated between

196
00:10:51,400 --> 00:10:53,400
going for two years

197
00:10:53,400 --> 00:10:55,400
up to Algonquin Park

198
00:10:55,400 --> 00:10:57,400
in Ontario, Canada,

199
00:10:57,400 --> 00:10:59,400
for a canoe trip

200
00:10:59,400 --> 00:11:01,400
and going over to

201
00:11:01,400 --> 00:11:03,400
Condersteg International Scout Center

202
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:05,400
for the third year.

203
00:11:05,400 --> 00:11:07,400
We started the canoe trips 10 years ago.

204
00:11:07,400 --> 00:11:09,400
We started doing the rotation through

205
00:11:09,400 --> 00:11:11,400
Condersteg four years ago.

206
00:11:11,400 --> 00:11:13,400
I also want to mention that

207
00:11:13,400 --> 00:11:15,400
