213
00:11:25,400 --> 00:11:27,400
and if you're interested,

214
00:11:27,400 --> 00:11:29,400
let's get going. we'll get that put together

215
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:31,400
so that in 2016,

216
00:11:31,400 --> 00:11:33,400
you can take a group of Scouts to Condersteg

217
00:11:33,400 --> 00:11:35,400
in Switzerland. but

218
00:11:35,400 --> 00:11:37,400
that's a pretty big trip.

219
00:11:37,400 --> 00:11:39,400
It's going to cost some money.

220
00:11:39,400 --> 00:11:41,400
These other trips that you can do,

221
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:43,400
these other high-adventure experiences

222
00:11:43,400 --> 00:11:45,400
that you can make happen for your Scouts,

223
00:11:45,400 --> 00:11:47,400
are not too expensive.

224
00:11:47,400 --> 00:11:49,400
A perfectly great high-adventure trip

225
00:11:49,400 --> 00:11:51,400
doesn't have to cost a lot of money.

226
00:11:51,400 --> 00:11:53,400
We've done backpacking trips

227
00:11:53,400 --> 00:11:55,400
of five days for less than $200..

228
00:11:55,400 --> 00:11:57,400
You know, you can

229
00:11:57,400 --> 00:11:59,400
set up the trip

230
00:11:59,400 --> 00:12:01,400
with the ability of your Scouts

231
00:12:01,400 --> 00:12:03,400
to participate in it. financially.

232
00:12:03,400 --> 00:12:05,400
It'll work.

233
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:07,400
I can tell you that it will work.

234
00:12:07,400 --> 00:12:09,400
We're going to talk about specifically

235
00:12:09,400 --> 00:12:11,400
how that will work just a little later on.

236
00:12:11,400 --> 00:12:13,400
The other objection is:

237
00:12:13,400 --> 00:12:15,400
a lot of people say I really don't have the time

238
00:12:15,400 --> 00:12:17,400
to put into a high-adventure trip.

239
00:12:17,400 --> 00:12:19,400
No, you don't

240
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,400
if it's going to be two weeks long.

241
00:12:21,400 --> 00:12:23,400
but there's nothing

242
00:12:23,400 --> 00:12:25,400
that says a high-adventure trip

243
00:12:25,400 --> 00:12:27,400
has to be

244
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:29,400
any certain number of days.

245
00:12:29,400 --> 00:12:31,400
A high-adventure trip can be

246
00:12:31,400 --> 00:12:33,400
three or four days,

247
00:12:33,400 --> 00:12:35,400
It can be 14 days, It can be 21 days,

248
00:12:35,400 --> 00:12:37,400
It can be five or six days.

249
00:12:37,400 --> 00:12:39,400
You make up your mind

250
00:12:39,400 --> 00:12:41,400
how much time you're going to have to spend.

251
00:12:41,400 --> 00:12:43,400
I know vacation days are precious

252
00:12:43,400 --> 00:12:45,400
when you have a family and you can't

253
00:12:45,400 --> 00:12:47,400
invest them all in a Scout trip.

254
00:12:47,400 --> 00:12:49,400
So, three days of vacation:

255
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:51,400
If you leave on a Wednesday, that means

256
00:12:51,400 --> 00:12:53,400
you've got Wednesday, Thursday and Friday.

257
00:12:53,400 --> 00:12:55,400
Then you have Saturday and Sunday.

258
